SUMMARY:Delegate's BBQ
DESCRIPTION:The Delegate’s BBQ\nCalifornia Northern Coastal Area Delegate\nChitra S.\nSharing her NYC Conference Experience \n\nEvent Details\nDate:\nMonday\, June 1\, 2026 \nSchedule:\nPotluck and BBQ – 6:00 PM to 7:30 PM\nDelegate Report – 7:30 PM to 9:15 PM \nLocation:\nFaith Lutheran Church\n4930 Newanga Ave\nSanta Rosa\, CA \n\nZoom Option\nZoom Meeting ID: 973 6892 3488\n\nJoin Zoom Meeting\n\nPasscode: Dist12GS \n\nAdditional Information\nParking is limited; carpooling recommended. \nHot dogs\, burgers\, veggie burgers\, and drinks provided. \nPlease bring a salad\, side dish\, or dessert to share. \nVolunteers Needed:\nCall Jonny W. at (707) 596-1527
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/delegates-bbq-3/
LOCATION:Faith Lutheran Church\, 4930 Newanga Ave.\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95405\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/delegatesbbq2026.png
END:VEVENT
